        "TileImage": "$($repository 585f8b0b-8ccb-4d59-b060-6613e1d554b8).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47\rWe are sending you into Paris France at the Sanguine fashion show downtown. We need you to eliminate 5 targets who were involved in a child abduction back in one of haven islands beach huts. The family have assigned us with the job and a promise of a hefty payout. All you need to do is assasinate them in a discrete manor , and the money will be wired to your account upon completion.\rGood Luck 47\r\rCreator - CrystalChar2318",
